{"2928570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Néro & Sci ∫ Integral Edition", "steam_appid": 2928570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>What the press is saying</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;[<i>Néro &amp; Sci ∫ Integral Edition</i>] quietly builds this world where logic and creativity meet, and somehow makes math feel… kind of magical again.&quot; -<strong><i> Linux Game Consortium</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The experience has such a unique personality that it's hard not to fall under its spell.&quot; 8/10 - <strong>GameFocus </strong>(Translated from French)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Whether you're a logic expert looking to test your limits on the secret levels or a casual gamer just wanting to enjoy a moment of smart relaxation, this game was made for you.&quot; - <strong>La Pause Geek </strong>(Translated from French)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/869a880c62dff1d9d7f887e27e4ac933.poster.avif?t=1787252711\" aria-label=\"Néro saute jusqu&#039;à un puzzle mathématique\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/869a880c62dff1d9d7f887e27e4ac933.webm?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/869a880c62dff1d9d7f887e27e4ac933.mp4?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Néro &amp; Sci are departing for an adventure in the world of Heméide, made of colorful shapes, numbers, and mathematical logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 levels across 4 different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 hours of content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the game the unlock more skill points and better your understanding of the puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or get a friend to join in local coop</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/9e3d1f00ad200a0f9d8d071f93dfc6e1.webp?t=1787252711\" width=146 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reveal the hidden mathematics behind the world around you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/bbbdf5c9ad2eafc8d1bf8e10e0f7688e.poster.avif?t=1787252711\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/bbbdf5c9ad2eafc8d1bf8e10e0f7688e.webm?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/bbbdf5c9ad2eafc8d1bf8e10e0f7688e.mp4?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe, experiment, and uncover the hidden logic behind every puzzle.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>White Dimension</strong> to reveal the hidden shapes, numbers, and vectors that make up the world of Heméide. Every puzzle becomes an experiment where observation and curiosity matter more than prior knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different approaches, form your own hypotheses, and gradually uncover the hidden logic behind every puzzle. The game's mechanics have been endorsed by the <strong>Institute for Research on Mathematics Education (IREM Lyon)</strong> to ensure every discovery feels intuitive and rewarding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No advanced mathematical knowledge is required.</strong> Thanks to a natural learning curve and an integrated hint system, anyone can solve the puzzles at their own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you solve this puzzle by placing the correct number of balls into each balance basket?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/39497492f0d126d8e129638c7b3aa3b8.poster.avif?t=1787252711\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/39497492f0d126d8e129638c7b3aa3b8.webm?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/39497492f0d126d8e129638c7b3aa3b8.mp4?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/9e3d1f00ad200a0f9d8d071f93dfc6e1.webp?t=1787252711\" width=146 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story of Néro &amp; Sci</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Néro is a young Synapsian who lives on the streets of Curiosita, the capital of the world of Heméide, home to a people wallowing in their achievements. He has taken refuge in the library of Psyga, whom he considers like his father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While cleaning out the basement of the library, Néro drops a jar containing Sci and knocks over a book that unleashes the Chaos theories and plunges them into the caves of Heméide, from which they will have to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot; Mathematics is a gymnastics of the mind and a preparation for philosophy.&quot; </i></strong>Isocrates .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/407f3a9b94c93fda530f1a84fc44ab58.poster.avif?t=1787252711\" aria-label=\"Sci déplace des cubes pour résoudre un puzzle\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/407f3a9b94c93fda530f1a84fc44ab58.webm?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/407f3a9b94c93fda530f1a84fc44ab58.mp4?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Néro &amp; Sci is a remastered and rebranded version of A Tale of Synapse: The Chaos Theories</strong> <br>What's new? </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional puzzles and new mechanics to discover</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New UI, accessibility, and combat improved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save system revamp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New languages supported </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck compatibility</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/869a880c62dff1d9d7f887e27e4ac933.poster.avif?t=1787252711\" aria-label=\"Néro saute jusqu&#039;à un puzzle mathématique\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/869a880c62dff1d9d7f887e27e4ac933.webm?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/869a880c62dff1d9d7f887e27e4ac933.mp4?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Néro &amp; Sci are departing for an adventure in the world of Heméide, made of colorful shapes, numbers, and mathematical logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 levels across 4 different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 hours of content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the game the unlock more skill points and better your understanding of the puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or get a friend to join in local coop</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/9e3d1f00ad200a0f9d8d071f93dfc6e1.webp?t=1787252711\" width=146 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reveal the hidden mathematics behind the world around you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/bbbdf5c9ad2eafc8d1bf8e10e0f7688e.poster.avif?t=1787252711\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/bbbdf5c9ad2eafc8d1bf8e10e0f7688e.webm?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/bbbdf5c9ad2eafc8d1bf8e10e0f7688e.mp4?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe, experiment, and uncover the hidden logic behind every puzzle.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>White Dimension</strong> to reveal the hidden shapes, numbers, and vectors that make up the world of Heméide. Every puzzle becomes an experiment where observation and curiosity matter more than prior knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different approaches, form your own hypotheses, and gradually uncover the hidden logic behind every puzzle. The game's mechanics have been endorsed by the <strong>Institute for Research on Mathematics Education (IREM Lyon)</strong> to ensure every discovery feels intuitive and rewarding.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No advanced mathematical knowledge is required.</strong> Thanks to a natural learning curve and an integrated hint system, anyone can solve the puzzles at their own pace.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you solve this puzzle by placing the correct number of balls into each balance basket?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/39497492f0d126d8e129638c7b3aa3b8.poster.avif?t=1787252711\" width=800 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/39497492f0d126d8e129638c7b3aa3b8.webm?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/39497492f0d126d8e129638c7b3aa3b8.mp4?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/9e3d1f00ad200a0f9d8d071f93dfc6e1.webp?t=1787252711\" width=146 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story of Néro &amp; Sci</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Néro is a young Synapsian who lives on the streets of Curiosita, the capital of the world of Heméide, home to a people wallowing in their achievements. He has taken refuge in the library of Psyga, whom he considers like his father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While cleaning out the basement of the library, Néro drops a jar containing Sci and knocks over a book that unleashes the Chaos theories and plunges them into the caves of Heméide, from which they will have to escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot; Mathematics is a gymnastics of the mind and a preparation for philosophy.&quot; </i></strong>Isocrates .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/407f3a9b94c93fda530f1a84fc44ab58.poster.avif?t=1787252711\" aria-label=\"Sci déplace des cubes pour résoudre un puzzle\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/407f3a9b94c93fda530f1a84fc44ab58.webm?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2928570/extras/407f3a9b94c93fda530f1a84fc44ab58.mp4?t=1787252711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Néro &amp; Sci i